00:01:33.199 --> 00:01:34.279
to a new chapter?

00:01:34.279 --> 00:01:38.279
If it's even possible, I think you would have to admit that there's another possibility,

00:01:38.279 --> 00:01:41.320
therefore he's not pro-crime, at least in possibility.

